<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 15.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 15.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 15	Nov 14	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.940     237.540     237.040    0.38 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.080     302.840     303.640   -0.18 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.950     157.815     165.490   -4.56 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.730	46.686	48.410   -3.47 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  396.120     395.800     366.280    8.15 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.860     140.700     147.886   -4.75 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.690	15.668	14.975    4.77 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.000     212.670     230.135   -7.01 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.877	 1.875	 1.939   -3.20 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.562	 1.561	 1.575   -0.83 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.900     187.075     206.030   -9.29 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
